    "detailed_description": "<h1>Playtest LavaLoop</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/a1d7c16348e4c164fa3f4796120ca848.avif?t=1748431585\" data-has-big width=800 height=211 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want to playtest LavaLoop, join the Discord server : : </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or send me a message :)</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a shot of <strong>shoot'em up</strong>, a note of <strong>rhythm game</strong> and a touch of <strong>platformer</strong>: the explosive cocktail of <strong>LavaLoop</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/25f7a4ed2d4e888fe40b687e36d7adc0.poster.avif?t=1748431585\" width=616 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/25f7a4ed2d4e888fe40b687e36d7adc0.webm?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/25f7a4ed2d4e888fe40b687e36d7adc0.mp4?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three musician-fighters with their own unique skills. Will you choose :<br><strong>No\u00eb</strong>, Champion of combos \ud83c\udfb9 armed with a cannon-hook-piano-arm,<br><strong>Manita</strong>, the mushroom dancer \ud83c\udf44 who only fights hand-to-hand,\u00a0<br>Or <strong>L\u00e9onie</strong>, the fishier-knight who machine-guns fish \ud83d\udc1f in every direction.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/eed054e0939e281190413606009b5581.poster.avif?t=1748431585\" width=616 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/eed054e0939e281190413606009b5581.webm?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/eed054e0939e281190413606009b5581.mp4?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fun of rhythm games</strong> \ud83c\udfb5 without the difficulty! Move in rhythm to be rewarded with explosive combos, never penalised. Each enemy moves and attacks to its own score, creating a <strong>procedural soundtrack</strong>. Learn their moves to counter-attack in style! And an <strong>easy mode</strong> greatly reduces the rhythmic demands :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/5eb7697381fb49234699aa4f728fe672.poster.avif?t=1748431585\" width=616 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/5eb7697381fb49234699aa4f728fe672.webm?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/5eb7697381fb49234699aa4f728fe672.mp4?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meticulous art direction for an edgy gameplay inspired by the greatest arcade shooters from \ud83d\udc7e <strong>Space Invaders</strong> to <strong>Cuphead</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/cd9b4d918f7dbd7ea459dd81f4b8f8d9.poster.avif?t=1748431585\" width=616 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/cd9b4d918f7dbd7ea459dd81f4b8f8d9.webm?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/cd9b4d918f7dbd7ea459dd81f4b8f8d9.mp4?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mad queen has launched the construction of a giant power station: The Drill. The planet now vibrates to the rhythm of this infernal machine, and one natural disaster follows another...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/75efc0bd3ae75d0cae4fa613af8fd578.poster.avif?t=1748431585\" width=616 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/75efc0bd3ae75d0cae4fa613af8fd578.webm?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/75efc0bd3ae75d0cae4fa613af8fd578.mp4?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all starts in my sketchbooks, where I create a world bursting with punk spirit. I was inspired by the retro-futuristic style found in the works of <strong>Jules Vernes</strong> and the cartoons of <strong>Hayao Miyazaki</strong>. The player will travel through 5 worlds with eclectic styles and musics, and discover an <strong>ecological fable</strong> about <strong>the cycle of life</strong> and <strong>creativity</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/1bf6e2eff22d16cbd2a6987dd6e34672.poster.avif?t=1748431585\" width=616 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/1bf6e2eff22d16cbd2a6987dd6e34672.webm?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/1bf6e2eff22d16cbd2a6987dd6e34672.mp4?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a solo developer, creator of Iris and the Giant (Goblinz Studio), as well as a pop-up book illustrator, graphic designer and 2D animator. I started coding about fifteen years ago. For almost two years now, I've been putting everything aside to launch LavaLoop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LavaLoop is a short, intense gaming experience, a fable about the destruction of nature and the hold technology has on our lives, but also a tribute to artistic and musical creativity.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>To support me, go and press ADD TO WISHLIST and FOLLOW. <br>Thank you for supporting the crazy project of a passionate indie dev!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Credits </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story, Art, Game Design, Code</strong>: Louis Rigaud</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music</strong>: Raphael Joffres / Fractal Edge Music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound Design</strong>: Romain Raynal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project was supported by the CNC, Game Crealab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a shot of <strong>shoot'em up</strong>, a note of <strong>rhythm game</strong> and a touch of <strong>platformer</strong>: the explosive cocktail of <strong>LavaLoop</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/25f7a4ed2d4e888fe40b687e36d7adc0.poster.avif?t=1748431585\" width=616 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/25f7a4ed2d4e888fe40b687e36d7adc0.webm?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/25f7a4ed2d4e888fe40b687e36d7adc0.mp4?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three musician-fighters with their own unique skills. Will you choose :<br><strong>No\u00eb</strong>, Champion of combos \ud83c\udfb9 armed with a cannon-hook-piano-arm,<br><strong>Manita</strong>, the mushroom dancer \ud83c\udf44 who only fights hand-to-hand,\u00a0<br>Or <strong>L\u00e9onie</strong>, the fishier-knight who machine-guns fish \ud83d\udc1f in every direction.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/eed054e0939e281190413606009b5581.poster.avif?t=1748431585\" width=616 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/eed054e0939e281190413606009b5581.webm?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/eed054e0939e281190413606009b5581.mp4?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fun of rhythm games</strong> \ud83c\udfb5 without the difficulty! Move in rhythm to be rewarded with explosive combos, never penalised. Each enemy moves and attacks to its own score, creating a <strong>procedural soundtrack</strong>. Learn their moves to counter-attack in style! And an <strong>easy mode</strong> greatly reduces the rhythmic demands :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/5eb7697381fb49234699aa4f728fe672.poster.avif?t=1748431585\" width=616 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/5eb7697381fb49234699aa4f728fe672.webm?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/5eb7697381fb49234699aa4f728fe672.mp4?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meticulous art direction for an edgy gameplay inspired by the greatest arcade shooters from \ud83d\udc7e <strong>Space Invaders</strong> to <strong>Cuphead</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/cd9b4d918f7dbd7ea459dd81f4b8f8d9.poster.avif?t=1748431585\" width=616 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/cd9b4d918f7dbd7ea459dd81f4b8f8d9.webm?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/cd9b4d918f7dbd7ea459dd81f4b8f8d9.mp4?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mad queen has launched the construction of a giant power station: The Drill. The planet now vibrates to the rhythm of this infernal machine, and one natural disaster follows another...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/75efc0bd3ae75d0cae4fa613af8fd578.poster.avif?t=1748431585\" width=616 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/75efc0bd3ae75d0cae4fa613af8fd578.webm?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/75efc0bd3ae75d0cae4fa613af8fd578.mp4?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all starts in my sketchbooks, where I create a world bursting with punk spirit. I was inspired by the retro-futuristic style found in the works of <strong>Jules Vernes</strong> and the cartoons of <strong>Hayao Miyazaki</strong>. The player will travel through 5 worlds with eclectic styles and musics, and discover an <strong>ecological fable</strong> about <strong>the cycle of life</strong> and <strong>creativity</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/1bf6e2eff22d16cbd2a6987dd6e34672.poster.avif?t=1748431585\" width=616 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/1bf6e2eff22d16cbd2a6987dd6e34672.webm?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017100/extras/1bf6e2eff22d16cbd2a6987dd6e34672.mp4?t=1748431585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm a solo developer, creator of Iris and the Giant (Goblinz Studio), as well as a pop-up book illustrator, graphic designer and 2D animator. I started coding about fifteen years ago. For almost two years now, I've been putting everything aside to launch LavaLoop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LavaLoop is a short, intense gaming experience, a fable about the destruction of nature and the hold technology has on our lives, but also a tribute to artistic and musical creativity.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>To support me, go and press ADD TO WISHLIST and FOLLOW. <br>Thank you for supporting the crazy project of a passionate indie dev!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- - - - -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Credits </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story, Art, Game Design, Code</strong>: Louis Rigaud</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music</strong>: Raphael Joffres / Fractal Edge Music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound Design</strong>: Romain Raynal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project was supported by the CNC, Game Crealab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
